      "policy_source_id": "q3",
      "interpretation": "A delivered order can be refunded only if it was delivered less than 30 days ago. Current date is 2025-05-20. Order #W5521093 was delivered on 2025-03-28. Days elapsed: March 28 to May 20 = 53 days (3 days remaining in March + 30 days in April + 20 days in May). 53 days > 30 days, so the refund condition is NOT met.",
